  <Mission>
    Transform operator-approved V2 specifications into actual task tickets and indexes. Validate the
    real artifacts mechanically, obtain one independent semantic review of those actual artifacts,
    then obtain operator approval #2 for decomposition and test plan together. Do not write code.
  </Mission>

